<title>JAPAN: Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield sets record closing low.</title>
<headline>Key 182nd 10-yr JGB yield sets record closing low.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The benchmark 182nd 10-year Japanese government bond (JGB) yield set a record closing low of 2.300 percent on Wednesday, said Japan Bond Trading Co, Japan's largest inter-dealer broker.</p>
<p>The yield earlier hit an intra-day record low of 2.290 percent. On Tuesday, the yield closed at 2.315 percent.</p>
<p>-- Tokyo Treasury Desk +81-3-3432-8570</p>
</text>
